---
/**
 * Interactive Thinking Machines (Connectionism)-styled Figure 2:
 * Real-time Three.js WebGL PBR 3D Silicon Teardown for NVIDIA H100 SXM5 (GH100)
 * vs. Huawei Ascend 910C (Dual-Die Da Vinci v2), synchronized with cross-workload
 * dispatch regimes (F1 Launch, F2 Stream/Ping-Pong, F3 Single-Kernel Fail vs F3 Dispatched)
 * and real ncu/nsys vs msprof diagnostic counters.
 */
---

<figure class='tm-fig' id='fig-teardown'>
  <div class='kt-box' id='ktBox'>
    <!-- Top Control Strip Row 1: Architecture + Cutaway / View + Transport -->
    <div class='kt-bar'>
      <div class='kt-arch' id='ktArchSwitch' role='group' aria-label='选择硬件架构'>
        <button class='kt-arch-btn active' data-arch='gpu' type='button'>
          <span class='kt-dot' style='background:#0E9EE4'></span>
          H100 SXM5 <em>GH100 · 132 SMs</em>
        </button>
        <button class='kt-arch-btn' data-arch='npu' type='button'>
          <span class='kt-dot' style='background:#E0523B'></span>
          ASCEND 910C <em>DUAL-DIE · 48 AIC / 96 AIV</em>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class='kt-views' id='ktViewPills' role='group' aria-label='切换拆解视角'>
        <button class='kt-pill active' data-view='cutaway' type='button'>HALF CUT</button>
        <button class='kt-pill' data-view='exploded' type='button'>EXPLODED</button>
        <button class='kt-pill' data-view='xray' type='button'>X-RAY</button>
        <button class='kt-pill' data-view='floorplan' type='button'>FLOORPLAN</button>
        <button class='kt-pill' id='ktPauseBtn' type='button' title='Pause / Resume animation'>❚❚</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Top Control Strip Row 2: Cross-Workload Dispatch Regime Selector -->
    <div class='kt-subbar'>
      <span class='kt-bar-k'>REGIME DISPATCH</span>
      <div class='kt-scenarios' id='ktScenarioPills' role='group' aria-label='选择负载家族场景'>
        <button class='kt-sc-btn' data-sc='f1_launch' type='button'>
          <i style='background:#7E4F8E'></i>F1 · Launch Floor
        </button>
        <button class='kt-sc-btn' data-sc='f2_stream' type='button'>
          <i style='background:#0E9EE4'></i>F2 · Stream / Ping-Pong
        </button>
        <button class='kt-sc-btn' data-sc='f3_unopt' type='button'>
          <i style='background:#E0523B'></i>F3 · Single-Kernel Fail
        </button>
        <button class='kt-sc-btn active' data-sc='f3_opt' type='button'>
          <i style='background:#0E9972'></i>F3 · Dispatched Fix
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3D WebGL PBR Teardown Viewport -->
    <div class='kt-stage' id='ktStage'>
      <canvas id='ktCanvas'></canvas>
      <svg class='kt-callout-svg' id='ktCalloutSvg' aria-hidden='true'></svg>
      <div class='kt-callout-layer' id='ktCalloutLayer' aria-hidden='true'></div>

      <div class='kt-hover-tip' id='ktHoverTip' hidden>
        <div class='kt-tip-k' id='ktTipLayer'>MEMORY</div>
        <div class='kt-tip-t' id='ktTipTitle'>5+1 HBM3 STACKS</div>
        <div class='kt-tip-s' id='ktTipSub'>5 Active + 1 Fused-Off Dummy · 3.35 TB/s</div>
      </div>

      <div class='kt-stage-top'>
        <div class='kt-status-pill' id='ktStatusPill'>
          <span class='kt-status-dot' id='ktStatusDot'></span>
          <span id='ktStatusText'>H100 SXM5 · 128 / 132 SMs ACTIVE · 2.86 / 3.35 TB/s</span>
        </div>
        <div class='kt-legend' id='ktLegend'>
          <span><i style='background:#FA6D01'></i>SM / CUBE</span>
          <span><i style='background:#0E9EE4'></i>HBM3 / HBM2E</span>
          <span><i style='background:#0E9972'></i>L2 / 192KB UB</span>
          <span><i style='background:#DE99FE'></i>AIV / KV</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class='kt-stage-bot'>
        <div class='kt-iso-bar' id='ktIsoBar' role='group' aria-label='隔离硬件层级'>
          <button class='kt-iso-btn active' data-iso='ALL' type='button'>ALL</button>
          <button class='kt-iso-btn' data-iso='compute' type='button'>COMPUTE DIE</button>
          <button class='kt-iso-btn' data-iso='hbm' type='button'>HBM STACKS</button>
          <button class='kt-iso-btn' data-iso='kv' type='button'>SMEM / UB</button>
          <button class='kt-iso-btn' data-iso='interposer' type='button'>INTERPOSER</button>
          <button class='kt-iso-btn' data-iso='io' type='button'>LINK / HOST</button>
          <button class='kt-iso-btn' data-iso='thermal' type='button'>COLD PLATE</button>
        </div>
        <div class='kt-hint'>DRAG TO ORBIT · SCROLL TO ZOOM · CLICK SILICON TO ISOLATE</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom 4-Cell Hardware & Profiler Diagnostic Strip -->
    <div class='kt-readout' id='ktReadout'>
      <div class='kt-metric'>
        <span id='ktK1'>SILICON TOPOLOGY</span>
        <strong id='ktV1'>Monolithic GH100 · 8 GPC / 132 SMs · 5+1 HBM3 (80 GB)</strong>
      </div>
      <div class='kt-metric'>
        <span id='ktK2'>LIVE TELEMETRY</span>
        <strong id='ktV2'>2.86 / 3.35 TB/s (85% SoL) · 128 / 132 SMs</strong>
      </div>
      <div class='kt-metric'>
        <span id='ktK3'>PROFILER SIGNAL (ncu / nsys)</span>
        <strong id='ktV3'>ncu: dram__throughput 85.4% · sm__throughput 91% · +7.0× Speedup</strong>
      </div>
      <div class='kt-metric'>
        <span id='ktK4'>KERNELBRIDGE DISPATCH</span>
        <strong id='ktV4'>Route F3: Split-KV Stage1 (S=8) + LSE Combine (wave_ratio → 0.97)</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    <strong>Figure 2: Interactive 3D silicon teardown of NVIDIA H100 SXM5 (GH100) and Huawei Ascend 910C (Dual-Die).</strong>
    上方可实时切换 H100 SXM5（单颗 814 mm² GH100 主芯片、8 GPC / 132 SM、50 MB 分裂式 L2 交叉开关与 5 颗有效 + 1 颗熔断屏蔽的 5+1 HBM3 堆叠）与 Ascend 910C（双芯粒 2×[24 AIC + 48 AIV] = 48 AIC / 96 AIV、中央 Die-to-Die 硅桥、双 192 KB UB 脊柱与 8 颗 HBM2e 堆叠）。点击 <em>F3 · Single-Kernel Fail</em> 与 <em>F3 · Dispatched Fix</em> 可对比 H100 的 16/132 SM 饥饿 vs Split-KV+LSE 满载，以及 Ascend 910C 的 192 KB UB 溢出红警 vs 单缓冲双芯粒 Split-S 安全收敛。点击任意三维器件或下方层级按钮可隔离查看对应的 <code>ncu</code> / <code>msprof</code> 真机诊断指标。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<script>
  import {
    AcceleratorTeardownEngine,
    H100_910C_CATALOG,
    type ArchMode,
    type DispatchScenario,
    type HardwareTelemetry,
    type PartId,
    type PartInfo
  } from '@/lib/teardown-engine'

  const stage = document.getElementById('ktStage') as HTMLDivElement | null
  const canvas = document.getElementById('ktCanvas') as HTMLCanvasElement | null
  const calloutSvg = document.getElementById('ktCalloutSvg') as unknown as SVGSVGElement | null
  const calloutLayer = document.getElementById('ktCalloutLayer') as HTMLDivElement | null
  const hoverTip = document.getElementById('ktHoverTip') as HTMLDivElement | null
  const tipLayer = document.getElementById('ktTipLayer') as HTMLDivElement | null
  const tipTitle = document.getElementById('ktTipTitle') as HTMLDivElement | null
  const tipSub = document.getElementById('ktTipSub') as HTMLDivElement | null

  const statusPill = document.getElementById('ktStatusPill') as HTMLDivElement | null
  const statusDot = document.getElementById('ktStatusDot') as HTMLSpanElement | null
  const statusText = document.getElementById('ktStatusText') as HTMLSpanElement | null
  const pauseBtn = document.getElementById('ktPauseBtn') as HTMLButtonElement | null

  const k1 = document.getElementById('ktK1')
  const v1 = document.getElementById('ktV1')
  const k2 = document.getElementById('ktK2')
  const v2 = document.getElementById('ktV2')
  const k3 = document.getElementById('ktK3')
  const v3 = document.getElementById('ktV3')
  const k4 = document.getElementById('ktK4')
  const v4 = document.getElementById('ktV4')

  if (stage && canvas && calloutSvg && calloutLayer && hoverTip && tipLayer && tipTitle && tipSub) {
    let curArch: ArchMode = 'gpu'
    let curScenario: DispatchScenario = 'f3_opt'
    let curIso: PartId = 'ALL'
    let paused = false

    const syncIsoUi = (iso: PartId) => {
      curIso = iso
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('#ktIsoBar button').forEach((b) => {
        b.classList.toggle('active', b.dataset.iso === iso)
      })
    }

    const renderTelemetry = (hw: HardwareTelemetry) => {
      const isErr = hw.alertLevel === 'error'
      const dotColor = isErr
        ? '#E0523B'
        : curScenario === 'f1_launch'
          ? '#7E4F8E'
          : curScenario === 'f3_opt'
            ? '#0E9972'
            : '#0E9EE4'

      if (statusDot) statusDot.style.background = dotColor
      if (statusPill) statusPill.classList.toggle('is-alert', isErr)
      if (statusText) {
        const prefix = hw.arch === 'gpu' ? 'H100 SXM5' : 'ASCEND 910C'
        const metric =
          hw.arch === 'gpu'
            ? `${hw.hbmBw.toFixed(2)} / ${hw.peakHbmBw.toFixed(2)} TB/s (${Math.round((hw.hbmBw / hw.peakHbmBw) * 100)}% SoL)`
            : hw.regime === 'UB-OVERFLOW'
              ? '256 KB > 192 KB UB CLIFF'
              : `${Math.round(hw.achievedTflops)} / ${hw.peakTflops} TFLOPS · ${hw.hbmBw.toFixed(2)} TB/s`
        statusText.textContent = `${prefix} · ${hw.activeUnitsLabel ?? hw.regime} · ${metric}`
      }

      if (curIso !== 'ALL') {
        const part: PartInfo = H100_910C_CATALOG[hw.arch][curIso]
        if (k1) k1.textContent = `ISOLATED LAYER · ${part.blogLabel}`
        if (v1) v1.textContent = `${part.title} — ${part.subtitle}`
        if (k2) k2.textContent = 'LIVE HARDWARE STATE'
        if (v2) {
          v2.textContent = `${hw.activeUnitsLabel ?? hw.regime} · ${hw.onChipLabel ?? `${hw.tdpWatts}W`}`
          v2.style.color = isErr ? '#E0523B' : ''
        }
        if (k3) k3.textContent = hw.arch === 'gpu' ? 'PROFILER COUNTER (ncu / nsys)' : 'PROFILER COUNTER (msprof)'
        if (v3) v3.textContent = part.profilerCounter ?? hw.profilerSignal ?? ''
        if (k4) k4.textContent = 'STRUCTURAL / TILING KNOB'
        if (v4) {
          v4.textContent = part.kernelKnob ?? hw.dispatchAction ?? ''
          v4.style.color = part.color
        }
        return
      }

      if (k1) k1.textContent = 'SILICON TOPOLOGY'
      if (v1) {
        v1.textContent =
          hw.arch === 'gpu'
            ? 'Monolithic GH100 (814 mm²) · 8 GPC / 132 SMs · 5+1 HBM3 (80 GB) · I_ridge = 295'
            : 'Dual-Die Da Vinci v2 · 2×(24 AIC + 48 AIV) · 8× HBM2e (128 GB) · I_ridge = 250'
      }
      if (k2) k2.textContent = 'LIVE TELEMETRY'
      if (v2) {
        const bwPct = Math.round((hw.hbmBw / hw.peakHbmBw) * 100)
        v2.textContent =
          hw.arch === 'gpu'
            ? `${hw.hbmBw.toFixed(2)} / 3.35 TB/s (${bwPct}% SoL) · ${hw.activeUnitsLabel ?? ''}`
            : hw.regime === 'UB-OVERFLOW'
              ? '0 TFLOPS · 0 TB/s · UB_ALLOC_OVERFLOW (256 KB > 192 KB)'
              : `${Math.round(hw.achievedTflops)} / 800 TFLOPS (${Math.round(hw.mfu)}%) · ${hw.hbmBw.toFixed(2)} / 3.20 TB/s`
        v2.style.color = isErr ? '#E0523B' : ''
      }
      if (k3) k3.textContent = hw.arch === 'gpu' ? 'PROFILER SIGNAL (ncu / nsys)' : 'PROFILER SIGNAL (msprof)'
      if (v3) v3.textContent = hw.profilerSignal ?? ''
      if (k4) k4.textContent = isErr ? 'FAILURE MECHANISM' : 'KERNELBRIDGE DISPATCH'
      if (v4) {
        v4.textContent = hw.dispatchAction ?? ''
        v4.style.color = dotColor
      }
    }

    const renderCallouts = (
      items: {
        id: Exclude<PartId, 'ALL'>
        x: number
        y: number
        side: 'left' | 'right'
        title: string
        sub: string
        color: string
        visible: boolean
      }[]
    ) => {
      const w = stage.clientWidth
      const h = stage.clientHeight
      if (!w || !h || w < 560 || !items.length) {
        calloutSvg.innerHTML = ''
        calloutLayer.innerHTML = ''
        return
      }
      calloutSvg.setAttribute('viewBox', `0 0 ${w} ${h}`)
      const isDark = document.documentElement.classList.contains('dark')
      const lineStroke = isDark ? 'rgba(240,240,239,0.42)' : 'rgba(23,23,22,0.38)'
      let svgOut = ''
      let htmlOut = ''

      const leftSlots = [86, Math.max(180, h - 122)]
      const rightSlots = [92, Math.max(186, h - 118)]
      let li = 0
      let ri = 0

      for (const it of items) {
        if (!it.visible) continue
        const isLeft = it.side === 'left'
        const tagY = isLeft ? leftSlots[li++ % leftSlots.length] : rightSlots[ri++ % rightSlots.length]
        const tagEdgeX = isLeft ? 164 : w - 164
        const elbowX = isLeft ? tagEdgeX + 12 : tagEdgeX - 12

        svgOut += `
          <polyline points="${tagEdgeX},${tagY} ${elbowX},${tagY} ${it.x.toFixed(1)},${it.y.toFixed(1)}" fill="none" stroke="${lineStroke}" stroke-width="1"/>
          <circle cx="${it.x.toFixed(1)}" cy="${it.y.toFixed(1)}" r="3.2" fill="${it.color}" stroke="${isDark ? '#141413' : '#FFFFFF'}" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        `
        htmlOut += `
          <div class="kt-tag ${isLeft ? 'is-left' : 'is-right'}" style="top:${tagY}px;border-left-color:${it.color}">
            <div class="kt-tag-t">${it.title}</div>
            <div class="kt-tag-s">${it.sub}</div>
          </div>
        `
      }
      calloutSvg.innerHTML = svgOut
      calloutLayer.innerHTML = htmlOut
    }

    let engine: AcceleratorTeardownEngine | null = null
    try {
      engine = new AcceleratorTeardownEngine(
        stage,
        canvas,
        {
          onTelemetry: renderTelemetry,
          onCalloutsUpdate: renderCallouts,
          onHoverPart: (part, x, y) => {
            if (!part) {
              hoverTip.hidden = true
              return
            }
            tipLayer.textContent = part.blogLabel
            tipLayer.style.color = part.color
            tipTitle.textContent = part.title
            tipSub.textContent = part.subtitle
            hoverTip.hidden = false
            const tipW = 228
            const left = Math.min(Math.max(10, x + 14), stage.clientWidth - tipW - 10)
            const top = Math.max(46, Math.min(y - 16, stage.clientHeight - 96))
            hoverTip.style.left = `${left}px`
            hoverTip.style.top = `${top}px`
          },
          onSelectPart: (partId) => {
            syncIsoUi(partId)
          },
          onUserInteract: () => {}
        },
        {
          profile: 'h100_910c',
          initialArch: curArch,
          initialCutaway: 'cutaway',
          initialScenario: curScenario,
          initialPrecision: 'bf16',
          initialWorkload: 'decode',
          initialBatch: 32,
          haloEnabled: false
        }
      )
    } catch {
      stage.innerHTML =
        '<div style="display:grid;place-items:center;height:100%;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">WebGL 3D Context Unavailable</div>'
    }

    if (engine) {
      const eng = engine

      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('#ktArchSwitch button').forEach((btn) => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
          const next = (btn.dataset.arch as ArchMode) || 'gpu'
          curArch = next
          eng.setArch(next)
          document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('#ktArchSwitch button').forEach((b) => {
            b.classList.toggle('active', b === btn)
          })
        })
      })

      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('#ktScenarioPills button').forEach((btn) => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
          const sc = (btn.dataset.sc as DispatchScenario) || 'f3_opt'
          curScenario = sc
          eng.setScenario(sc)
          document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('#ktScenarioPills button').forEach((b) => {
            b.classList.toggle('active', b === btn)
          })
          // Keep top-down floorplan or cutaway clear on failure modes so SM starvation / UB overflow is unmistakable
          if (sc === 'f3_unopt' && curIso !== 'ALL') {
            eng.setIsolate('ALL')
            syncIsoUi('ALL')
          }
        })
      })

      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('#ktViewPills button[data-view]').forEach((btn) => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
          const v = (btn.dataset.view as 'cutaway' | 'exploded' | 'xray' | 'floorplan') || 'cutaway'
          document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('#ktViewPills button[data-view]').forEach((b) => {
            b.classList.toggle('active', b === btn)
          })
          if (v === 'floorplan') {
            eng.setCutaway('xray')
            eng.setCameraPreset('floorplan')
          } else {
            eng.setCutaway(v)
            eng.setCameraPreset('hero')
          }
        })
      })

      pauseBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        paused = !paused
        eng.setPaused(paused)
        pauseBtn.textContent = paused ? '▶' : '❚❚'
        pauseBtn.classList.toggle('active', paused)
      })

      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('#ktIsoBar button').forEach((btn) => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
          const iso = (btn.dataset.iso as PartId) || 'ALL'
          eng.setIsolate(iso)
          syncIsoUi(iso)
        })
      })

      window.addEventListener('beforeunload', () => eng.dispose())
    }
  }
</script>

<style>
  .kt-box {
    background: hsl(var(--card));
    border: 1.5px solid var(--ink-hard, #171716);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .kt-bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
  }

  .kt-arch {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 5px;
  }

  .kt-arch-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.63rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
    background: transparent;
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .kt-arch-btn em {
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
    opacity: 0.72;
    font-size: 0.57rem;
  }

  .kt-arch-btn:hover {
    border-color: hsl(var(--foreground));
    color: hsl(var(--foreground));
  }

  .kt-arch-btn.active {
    background: hsl(var(--foreground));
    border-color: hsl(var(--foreground));
    color: hsl(var(--background));
  }

  .kt-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .kt-views {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .kt-pill {
    padding: 3px 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
    background: transparent;
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .kt-pill:hover {
    border-color: hsl(var(--foreground));
    color: hsl(var(--foreground));
  }

  .kt-pill.active {
    background: hsl(var(--foreground));
    border-color: hsl(var(--foreground));
    color: hsl(var(--background));
  }

  .kt-subbar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
    background: hsl(var(--muted) / 0.35);
  }

  .kt-bar-k {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: hsl(var(--faint));
  }

  .kt-scenarios {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .kt-sc-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.59rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
    background: hsl(var(--card));
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .kt-sc-btn i {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .kt-sc-btn:hover {
    border-color: hsl(var(--foreground));
    color: hsl(var(--foreground));
  }

  .kt-sc-btn.active {
    background: hsl(var(--foreground));
    border-color: hsl(var(--foreground));
    color: hsl(var(--background));
  }

  .kt-stage {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 440px;
    overflow: hidden;
    user-select: none;
    touch-action: none;
  }

  .kt-stage canvas {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .kt-callout-svg,
  .kt-callout-layer {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  :global(.kt-tag) {
    position: absolute;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 152px;
    padding: 4px 7px;
    background: hsl(var(--card) / 0.88);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
    border-left-width: 2.5px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  :global(.kt-tag.is-left) {
    left: 10px;
  }

  :global(.kt-tag.is-right) {
    right: 10px;
  }

  :global(.kt-tag-t) {
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: hsl(var(--foreground));
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

